# Burst Lightning at a planeswalker: unkicked it removes two loyalty counters from Bot2's Narset, Parter of Veils (5 to
# 3), and a kicked one (4 damage instead of 2) then takes the remaining three and more, so Narset has 0 loyalty and is
# put into the graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5i).

